hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"31","[AI-translation] Muazzin jo kahe wahi dohrae; lekin (namaz ki taraf aao aur kamyabi ki taraf aao) ki jagah kahe: Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. Aur kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi saccha mabud nahin; woh akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahin; Muhammad us ke bande aur rasul hain. Rab ke taur par Allah se, rasul ke taur par Muhammad se aur deen ke taur par Islam se main razi hun. [Azan sunkar kahe]"
"32","[AI-translation] Muazzin ka jawab pura karne ke baad Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durud bheje."
"33","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Is kamil dawat aur qayam namaz ke Rab! Muhammad ko waseela aur fazeelat ata kar aur unhein us maqame-mahmud par pahuncha jis ka Tune un se wada kiya hai. [Azan ke baad padhe]"
"34","[AI-translation] Azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan apne liye dua kare; kyunke tab dua radd nahin hoti."
